worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_obligations.js"
  ceiling 477
  rationale "Issue #1166 R1166-4 browser twin of rust/src/intent_formalization/obligations.rs: the obligation graph of a catalog write_program request (clauses_with_spans, the clause-level ObligationNode::build with its one-level checkable split from rust/src/task_decomposition.rs, derive_expectation, the seed-role clause classifier, coreference and bound_output_literals) and obligation_gap_lines behind the native gate request_carries_work_obligations || request_demands(CiWorkflow), so the worker records the same obligation_gap events as the WriteProgram branch of rust/src/solver.rs instead of omitting them. Vocabulary is the seed lexicon; the two data/meta decisions the worker cannot fetch (the expectation rules of obligation-evidence-contract.lino and the approved missing_operation_contract strategy) are mirrored and held equal to the files by rust/tests/web/issue-1166-worker-obligation-gaps.test.mjs."
